Object.assign(window.I18N['zh-SG'].text, {
  "Chapter 14": "第十四章",
  "Prelims & Storm Season": "预考与暴风雨季",
  "Chapter 15 — Results Day": "第十五章 — 放榜日",
  "August. JC2 prelims in five weeks, A-levels in ten. The library smells of highlighters and panic.": "八月。离初院二年级预考还有五个星期，离A水准会考还有十个星期。图书馆里弥漫着荧光笔和恐慌的味道。",
  "{her}": "{her}",
  "are u there": "你在吗",
  "helloooo": "哈～喽～",
  "why aren't u replying 🥺": "你为什么不回我🥺",
  "Study block, 7 to 10. I've answered every message for a week and remembered nothing. I've skipped CCA twice to be \"available\".": "读书时段，晚上7点到10点。我已经一个星期每条信息都秒回，结果什么都没读进去。为了“随时在线”，我已经翘了两次课外活动。",
  "bro one game. ONE. ok three": "兄弟打一局。就一局。好吧三局",
  "u skipped cca again? coach asked": "你又翘课外活动了？教练在问",
  "Study block, 7 to 10. I've been gaming with Haziq every night and skipped CCA twice. My notes are a crime scene.": "读书时段，晚上7点到10点。我每天晚上都在跟哈齐克打游戏，还翘了两次课外活动。我的笔记简直是犯罪现场。",
  "The study block is slipping away.": "读书时间正在一点点溜走。",
  "Agree on phone-free hours, one call at 10, and go back to CCA.": "约好不碰手机的时段，晚上10点通一次电话，然后回去参加课外活动。",
  "ok that's actually smart. 10pm call. i'll do the same 📚": "好吧这其实很聪明。晚上10点打给你。我也这样做📚",
  "fine. 10pm one game. and cca saturday, i'll come watch": "好啦。晚上10点打一局。还有星期六的课外活动，我会去看",
  "Being always available is not love. It is a slow way of disappearing.": "随时在线不是爱。那是一种慢慢消失的方式。",
  "Answer every message. Skip CCA again.": "每条信息都回。又翘了课外活动。",
  "You studied nothing, played nothing, and she still felt ignored because you were half there. Everyone lost.": "你什么都没读，什么都没玩，而她还是觉得被冷落，因为你心不在焉。所有人都输了。",
  "Go silent without telling anyone.": "不告诉任何人，直接消失。",
  "Right idea, missing one sentence: \"I'm studying until 10, talk then.\" Silence without a reason reads as a problem.": "方向对了，就差一句话：“我读书读到10点，到时候再聊。”没有理由的沉默，看起来就像出了问题。",
  "Three all-nighters. Four cans of energy drink on the desk. Your hands are shaking slightly, which you decide is \"focus\".": "连续熬了三个通宵。桌上有四罐能量饮料。你的手微微发抖，你决定把这叫做“专注”。",
  "It's 2 AM. Paper 2 is tomorrow.": "凌晨2点。明天考卷二。",
  "Close the books. Eat, shower, sleep. Walk to school in the morning.": "合上书。吃东西，洗澡，睡觉。早上走路去学校。",
  "Memory is filed while you sleep. An all-nighter is studying with the save button switched off.": "记忆是在你睡觉的时候存档的。熬通宵读书，就是关掉存档键在读书。",
  "A fourth all-nighter. Just one more.": "第四个通宵。就再一个。",
  "You read the same paragraph eleven times. In the morning you can't remember the formula you wrote at 4 AM.": "同一段文字你读了十一遍。早上，你想不起凌晨4点写下的那条公式。",
  "Paper 3 is tomorrow. The energy drink is right there.": "明天考卷三。能量饮料就在手边。",
  "Stop. Sleep tonight, whatever happens.": "停下来。不管怎样，今晚一定要睡。",
  "A fifth all-nighter.": "第五个通宵。",
  "BAD END #22 — Energy Drink Speedrun": "BAD END #22 — 能量饮料速通",
  "Five nights without sleep, then you fell asleep twenty minutes into the paper. Sleep isn't a reward for finishing work; it is how your brain stores it. Exhausted students do worse, not better, and too much caffeine can also cause palpitations and anxiety.": "连续五个晚上没睡，结果考试开始二十分钟你就睡着了。睡眠不是做完功课的奖励，而是大脑储存知识的方式。精疲力竭的学生考得更差，而不是更好；摄入太多咖啡因还会导致心悸和焦虑。",
  "Her nenek was admitted to hospital last week. Hanis has been visiting every evening, then studying until 2 AM, and she says she's \"fine\" in a voice that is not fine.": "上星期她外婆住院了。哈妮丝每天晚上都去探望，然后读书读到凌晨2点，她用一种一点都不“没事”的声音说她“没事”。",
  "Her parents found out her prelim chemistry grade. Now it's medicine-or-nothing at every dinner. Xin Yi hasn't written a word of her own in a month.": "她父母知道了她预考的化学成绩。现在每顿晚饭都在说“不读医科就什么都不是”。欣怡已经一个月没写过一个属于自己的字了。",
  "She tore a hamstring two weeks before the SEA Games selection trial. Her parents are overseas, and her aunt keeps saying it's \"a sign to focus on studies\".": "东运会（SEA Games）选拔赛前两个星期，她的腿后肌拉伤了。她父母在国外，她阿姨一直说这是“老天叫你专心读书的信号”。",
  "A clip of hers went viral for the wrong reasons. The comments are vicious, her mum is working double shifts, and Elise has stopped streaming.": "她的一段视频因为不好的原因爆红了。评论区非常恶毒，她妈妈在打两份工，伊莉丝已经不直播了。",
  "I'm so tired. Of everything. Sorry. I'm being dramatic.": "我好累。对所有事都好累。对不起。我太夸张了。",
  "She's crying quietly on the platform.": "她在月台上默默地哭。",
  "Sit with her. Listen. \"You don't have to be okay. Would talking to the school counsellor help? I'll walk you there.\"": "陪她坐着。听她说。“你不用假装没事。找学校辅导员聊聊会有帮助吗？我陪你过去。”",
  "...You didn't try to fix it. Thank you. Maybe I will see the counsellor. Will you wait outside?": "……你没有试着帮我解决。谢谢你。也许我会去找辅导员。你会在外面等我吗？",
  "\"Cheer up. You're being dramatic. Everyone's stressed.\"": "“开心点啦。你太夸张了。大家压力都很大。”",
  "Right. Forget I said anything.": "好吧。当我什么都没说。",
  "She told you she was drowning and you graded her swimming. Listen first. Always.": "她告诉你她快溺水了，你却在给她的泳姿打分。先听。永远先听。",
  "Become her only support. Midnight calls, every night, skip your own revision.": "成为她唯一的依靠。每天晚上半夜通电话，放弃你自己的复习。",
  "Kind, and not sustainable. You are not a counsellor and you cannot be her only one. Help her reach other people, and look after yourself too.": "很善良，但撑不下去。你不是辅导员，你也不能是她唯一的依靠。帮她找到其他人，也要照顾好你自己。",
  "My dad said if I don't get into poly engineering I'm \"wasting the family's money\". I can't sleep, bro. I just... can't.": "我爸说我要是进不了理工学院的工程系，就是在“浪费家里的钱”。兄弟，我睡不着。我就是……睡不着。",
  "Haziq never talks like this.": "哈齐克从来不会这样说话。",
  "Listen. Then: \"Want me to come with you to the school counsellor?\"": "好好听。然后问：“要不要我陪你去找学校辅导员？”",
  "...Yeah. Okay. Don't tell the group chat.": "……嗯。好。别告诉群里的人。",
  "\"Bro, man up.\"": "“兄弟，像个男人一点。”",
  "Boys are told to \"man up\" right up until they stop talking at all. Listen to him.": "男生总是被要求“像个男人一点”，直到他们彻底不再开口。听他说。",
  "You told {her} you were studying tonight. You are at the mall arcade with Elise, and it was fun right up until Elise posted a story.": "你跟{her}说你今晚在读书。其实你和伊莉丝在商场的游戏中心，一直玩得很开心，直到伊莉丝发了一条限时动态。",
  "You told {her} you were studying tonight. You are at the mall arcade with Haziq, and it was fun right up until Haziq posted a story.": "你跟{her}说你今晚在读书。其实你和哈齐克在商场的游戏中心，一直玩得很开心，直到哈齐克发了一条限时动态。",
  "studying huh. nice arcade 🙂": "在读书啊。游戏中心不错嘛🙂",
  "You told Mum you were studying at the library. You are at the arcade with Haziq. Mum has just texted: \"Which library? I'm driving past to pick you up.\"": "你跟妈妈说你在图书馆读书。其实你和哈齐克在游戏中心。妈妈刚发来信息：“哪间图书馆？我开车经过，顺便接你。”",
  "Caught in a small lie.": "一个小谎被拆穿了。",
  "Come clean immediately. \"I lied. I needed a break and didn't want to admit it. Sorry.\"": "马上坦白。“我撒谎了。我需要休息一下，却不想承认。对不起。”",
  "thank u for not making it worse. next time just say \"i need a break\" lol. i'd have come": "谢谢你没让事情变得更糟。下次直接说“我需要休息一下”就好了哈哈。我会一起来的",
  "Mum picks you up from the arcade, unimpressed, and buys you both bubble tea anyway. \"Next time just tell me.\"": "妈妈从游戏中心把你接走，一脸不以为然，但还是给你们两个买了珍珠奶茶。“下次直接告诉我。”",
  "Double down with a bigger lie.": "撒一个更大的谎来圆谎。",
  "A lie told to cover a lie needs a third lie to cover it. You are now running a small, failing company.": "为了圆一个谎而撒的谎，还需要第三个谎来圆。你现在在经营一家小小的、快倒闭的公司。",
  "Get Haziq to fake an alibi in the group chat.": "叫哈齐克在群里帮你伪造不在场证明。",
  "BAD END #17 — The Alibi Group Chat": "BAD END #17 — 不在场证明群聊",
  "Haziq posted a fake library photo. It had yesterday's date on the whiteboard. Now it isn't a small lie: it is a planned deception with a witness. Small lies grow. The cheapest moment to tell the truth is always the first one.": "哈齐克发了一张假的图书馆照片。白板上写着昨天的日期。现在这不再是一个小谎了：这是一场有证人的蓄意欺骗。小谎会长大。说真话最便宜的时机，永远是第一时间。",
  "I've been thinking about this for weeks. I care about you. But I don't think we're good for each other right now. I need to end it.": "这件事我想了好几个星期。我在乎你。但我觉得我们现在对彼此都不好。我需要结束这段关系。",
  "Your chest goes very tight.": "你的胸口一阵发紧。",
  "\"It hurts. But I respect it. Thank you for everything, really.\"": "“很痛。但我尊重你的决定。真的谢谢你，为了所有的一切。”",
  "...Thank you for making this the kind of goodbye I can remember without wincing.": "……谢谢你让这成为一场我以后想起来不会皱眉的告别。",
  "She walks to the MRT. You don't follow. That is the hardest, kindest thing you have done all year.": "她走向地铁站。你没有跟上去。这是你今年做过最难、也最温柔的一件事。",
  "Beg. Send forty messages tonight. Wait outside her block tomorrow.": "哀求。今晚发四十条信息。明天在她家楼下等。",
  "Please stop. Waiting outside my home is scary, not romantic. I mean it: we're done.": "请停下来。在我家楼下等我很可怕，不是浪漫。我是认真的：我们结束了。",
  "No means no for breakups too. Following someone who left is not love. It is a reason for her to feel unsafe.": "分手的时候，“不”也是“不”。跟着一个已经离开的人不是爱，只会让她觉得不安全。",
  "Post a revenge story about her and find her new friends' accounts.": "发一条报复她的限时动态，再去找她新朋友的账号。",
  "BAD END #18 — Main Character Syndrome": "BAD END #18 — 主角病",
  "She left, and you made it a show: a revenge post, then watching her new friends' accounts. That is harassment, and it is the opposite of love. A breakup is not a betrayal you get to punish. It hurts, and the only healthy move is to let her go and look after yourself.": "她离开了，而你把它变成了一场表演：一条报复帖，然后一直盯着她新朋友的账号。这是骚扰，也是爱的反面。分手不是一场你可以去惩罚的背叛。它很痛，唯一健康的做法是放手，好好照顾自己。",
  "After the prelims. You're both exhausted, and it has been a hard term for the two of you.": "预考结束了。你们两个都精疲力竭，这个学期对你们俩来说都很难熬。",
  "Where are you two?": "你们两个现在怎么样？",
  "Still in it. \"This term was rough. Let's get through the A-levels together.\" Then plan one small, cheap thing to look forward to.": "还在一起。“这学期好难熬。我们一起撑过A水准吧。”然后计划一件小小的、便宜的事情来期待。",
  "Together. Okay. And the first thing after the last paper is prata. My treat.": "一起。好。考完最后一科，第一件事就是去吃印度煎饼。我请。",
  "Be honest: you think it might be time to end it, and say so kindly.": "老实说：你觉得也许是时候结束了，并且温柔地说出来。",
  "...I've been feeling it too. I'm sad. But I'm glad you said it gently, and to my face.": "……我也有这种感觉。我很难过。但我很高兴你是温柔地、当面说出来的。",
  "You both cry a little at the void deck, and then share the last curry puff. It's the right ending. It's still an ending.": "你们俩在组屋楼下哭了一会儿，然后分吃了最后一个咖喱角。这是对的结局。但它依然是一个结局。",
  "After the prelims. Nadia breaks up with Haziq, kindly and clearly. Haziq does not take it kindly or clearly.": "预考结束了。娜迪亚和哈齐克分手了，说得温柔又清楚。哈齐克接受得一点都不温柔，也一点都不清楚。",
  "3 AM. Her profile is open on your phone. Your thumb is hovering over your old chats.": "凌晨3点。你手机上开着她的个人主页。你的拇指悬在你们的旧聊天记录上。",
  "3 AM.": "凌晨3点。",
  "Close it. Mute her for a while. Message Haziq in the morning. Back to the routines that make you you.": "关掉。暂时把她设成静音。早上发信息给哈齐克。回到那些让你成为你自己的日常里。",
  "Muting isn't hating her. It's giving your heart a cast while it heals.": "设成静音不是恨她。是在你的心痊愈时，给它打上石膏。",
  "Read every old message until sunrise.": "把旧信息一条条读到天亮。",
  "Re-reading old chats is pressing on a bruise to check it still hurts. It does. Put the phone down.": "重读旧聊天记录，就像按着一块瘀青检查它还痛不痛。它还痛。放下手机。",
  "Send \"u up?\"": "发一句“睡了吗？”",
  "Read at 3:04 AM. No reply. Which is, honestly, the healthiest reply possible.": "凌晨3:04已读。没有回复。说实话，这是最健康的回复了。",
  "Haziq": "哈齐克",
  "3am. on her profile. should i text her. i'm gonna text her": "凌晨3点。在看她的主页。我要不要发信息给她。我要发了",
  "Haziq at 3 AM.": "凌晨3点的哈齐克。",
  "\"Don't. Mute her for a while. Run with me at 7. Supper on me tomorrow.\"": "“别发。暂时把她静音。早上7点跟我去跑步。明天宵夜我请。”",
  "ok. muted. 7am. if u oversleep i'm telling mei": "好。静音了。早上7点。你要是睡过头我就告诉小美",
  "\"Send it, what's the worst that could happen.\"": "“发啊，最坏又能怎样。”",
  "The worst that could happen is exactly what happened. Read, no reply, and Haziq feeling worse at 3:05.": "最坏的情况，正是刚才发生的事。已读，不回，凌晨3:05的哈齐克更难受了。",
  "The class trip after the A-levels costs $480. {her} can't afford it this year.": "A水准考完后的班级旅行要$480。{her}今年负担不起。",
  "At the MRT gantry, {her}'s card is short again. \"I'll pay for you, it's fine,\" you say. {her} frowns. \"I don't want to owe you.\"": "在地铁闸门前，{her}的卡又不够钱了。“我帮你付，没关系。”你说。{her}皱起眉头。“我不想欠你。”",
  "\"Can we talk about how we handle money between us, so nobody owes anyone?\"": "“我们可以聊聊两个人之间怎么处理钱的事吗？这样谁都不欠谁。”",
  "\"Let's each pay our own. Clean and simple.\"": "“各付各的。清楚又简单。”",
  "\"Take turns, and keep it fair over a month.\"": "“轮流付，一个月下来保持公平。”",
  "\"Whoever has more pays. That's what partners do.\"": "“谁钱多谁付。情侣本来就是这样。”",
  "\"It's literally two dollars. Don't make it a whole thing.\"": "“才两块钱而已。别搞得那么严重。”",
  "Losing someone doesn't mean you lost. Did you become a better person this year? Then you won something.": "失去一个人，不代表你输了。你今年有没有成为一个更好的人？有的话，你就赢得了一些东西。"
});
